  "description": "Read the ASP.NET Core HttpRequest body in middleware or filters without consuming it. Async-only, System.Text.Json by default, chunked-request safe, trimming and AOT compatible via the JsonTypeInfo<T> overload and the string/bytes methods (the reflection-based overload is annotated).",
