  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0: async-only API, System.Text.Json default, chunked/no-Content-Length support, CancellationToken, charset detection, FrameworkReference instead of legacy package, multi-target net8/net9/net10, trimming/AOT safe via the JsonTypeInfo<T> overload and the string/bytes methods (reflection overload annotated). Breaking: sync PeekBody removed, ISerializer replaced by IBodySerializer, Newtonsoft dependency removed.",
